      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since people could just make an alt account to view your profile (bio, status, links, etc.), this wouldn't be a reliable way of doing it.\n\nI would suggest instead to make it a \"show profile only to friends\" option, so only friends can see your profile.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
